# .clinerules Redux Slikenet (Fixed - exe stays in build/main for reproducibility)

##  ENVIRONMENT MATRIX & ARCHITECTURAL SAFEGUARDS
- Host Environment: Windows 11 | MSYS2 / MINGW64 Natively
- Toolchain: x64 Native Binary managed internally by CMake
- Current root /c/Games/D1s
- Project has a 2nd root folder for D2.
- Dynamic Project Root: /c/Games/D2s/ (read .clinerules in D2s's .clinerules for D2s Builds)


##  STRICT PIECEWISE & INCREMENTAL PROCESSING CONSTRAINTS
- NEVER use destructive directory-wiping clean commands (like `rm -rf`) under any circumstances unless with explicit permission given ei: when renaming/copy/pase sequence for exe's during build sequence.
- Always run non-destructive, incremental processing sequences from the root repo track.
- Work in Plan Mode first to draft structures before attempting modifications.
- KEY: Never remove the exe from build/main/ - it must remain available for ninja to rebuild/reference

##  TOOLCHAIN DIRECTIVE
- Toolchain configurations are fully automated via internal CMake parameters.
- Do NOT attempt to install, map, or configure external toolchains or compilers within this environment loop.

## NATIVE CMAKE BUILD PIPELINE (ENVIRONMENT PRE-CONFIGURED)
- Do NOT inject or manually export MSYS2/MinGW utility paths; CMake natively bypasses and manages the toolchain environment internally.

## D1s Redux Slikenet folder PATHS
- root dir:                		 ≡ C:/Games/D1s/
- exe landing folder:     	 ≡ C:/Games/D1s/build/main
- target straight to:     	 ≡ C:/Games/D1s/build/main/d1x-redux.exe
- testbench folders:      	 ≡ C:/Games/D1x/ ≡ C:/Games/D1x2/
- backup D1s D1x:          ≡ E:/BackUpDescent/backups/D1sBackup

- must copy d2x-redux.exe to BOTH testbench folders (D2x AND D2x2)
- must keep d2x-redux.exe in build/main/ so ninja can rebuild/reference it
- kill running D2x-Redux-SLikeNet.exe processes before copying (so testbench copy works)
- do NOT remove the exe from build/main/ - this breaks reproducibility

## REBUILD LIBRARIES and COMPILE

cd /c/Games/D1s
export PATH="/c/Programs/msys64/mingw64/bin:\$PATH"
cmake --build build -- -j10
   # Testbench Prep
if [ -f build/main/d1x-redux.exe ]; then
  mkdir -p /c/Games/D1x /c/Games/D1x2
  
  # Kill live game sessions safely
  taskkill //F //IM D1x-Redux-SLikeNet.exe 2>/dev/null || tskill D2x-Redux-SLikeNet 2>/dev/null; sleep 1
  
  # Only wipe files from the destination testbenches, never from build/main/
  rm -f /c/Games/D1x/D1x-Redux-SLikeNet.exe /c/Games/D1x2/D1x-Redux-SLikeNet.exe
  
  # Stage the fresh executable binaries
  cp -v build/main/d1x-redux.exe /c/Games/D1x/D1x-Redux-SLikeNet.exe
  cp -v build/main/d1x-redux.exe /c/Games/D1x2/D1x-Redux-SLikeNet.exe  
  echo "Confirm Complete"
fi

- at the end of the rebuild libraries and compile sequence for D2s, include Confirm Complete in cline chat or terminal window.

